OL,3,AUK business hit by 'daylight robbery'
OL,4,A1500% price hike for invoicing software
OL,5,
OL,6,FCustomers have shared their outrage
OL,7,Fafter an app used by many businesses to
OL,8,Ftrack timesheets and produce invoices
OL,9,Fhiked bills by as much as 1500%, with
OL,10,Fone person calling it "daylight
OL,11,Frobbery".
OL,13,FRichard Haldenby, head of UK
OL,14,Fconsultancy firm Salentis, told the BBC
OL,15,Fhis monthly bill had risen from $130
OL,16,F(#95.50) to $2,110.
OL,18,FOthers have reported similar price
OL,19,Fhikes online, with one person in the US
OL,20,Fsaying their annual charge went from
OL,21,F$2,800 to $23,000.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,117,105,200,160,0,100
